# Model Designer

Follow **`apps/model-designer/AGENTS.md`** as the source of truth for:

- HTML5 Canvas rendering (no DOM-based model blocks); atomic draw helpers under `src/canvas/`.
- No `Buffer`; use `Uint8Array` and `DataView` (`src/persistence/mldg-binary.ts`).
- Logic in **Managers** (`StateManager`, `EventManager`, `ConfigManager`, `DataManager`, `I18nManager`); interaction state changes only via `StateManager`.
- Dual-schema graph JSON: `engine_schema` + `designer_layout`; persistence only via `@mode-db/sdk` (no local files / localStorage).
- i18n: all user-visible strings in `src/i18n/locales/<locale>/{ui,engine,errors}.json`.

When editing this app, read `AGENTS.md` before large changes.
